    "pisco-base-d": "074ebdc000a8155f608c5770c55e396a4fc7e45ff7af39fc8ffa39dd8b863eaa"
  },
  "method": "Transform installed XYZ into plate coordinates using each object's recorded pose and yaw. At the flat, compare the first new deposited course to that object's preceding model course, skipping intermediate support-only heights. Intersect each deposition's nominal emitted-width footprint with prior emitted plastic. A full gap is deliberately unsupported in the middle. Count both full-width and partial-width landings at opposite ends, including physically continuous perimeter moves. Native support paths at any lower height are checked separately.",
  "measurement": "For each continuous axial road, sample its actual width a quarter millimetre into each land. A line midway through a transverse strip that overlaps prior material on both lands gives the free span and its installed XY endpoints. The available centreline contact lengths are limited to the local landing search. Speeds and fan values apply over the open core. This reading measures commands; sag, fusion and loaded fit require the print.",
